  <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>PROPOSAL 2: RESOLVED </B>that,
  upon effectiveness of the Authorised Share Capital Increase, Clause 8 of the second amended and restated memorandum of association
  of the Company as adopted by special resolution dated 9 April 2025 and further amended by resolution of directors dated 4 September
  2025 (the &ldquo;<B>Second Restated MA</B>&rdquo;) be deleted and replaced as follows:</FONT></TD>
