<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: left">
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>PROPOSAL 3: RESOLVED,</B> that, upon the effectiveness of Clause 8 of the second Restated
    MA and upon the Company&rsquo;s receipt of the consent to repurchase and application for shares from SKMA Capital and Investment
    Ltd (&ldquo;<B>SKMA</B>&rdquo;), the Company shall repurchase 402,500 Class A Ordinary Shares held by SKMA, in consideration of and
    out of the proceeds of the Company&rsquo;s new issuance of 402,500 Class B Ordinary Shares to SKMA, such as that SKMA would control
    85.61% of voting rights of the Company.</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&#9744;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&#9744;</TD>
  <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
  <TD>&#9744;</TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: left">
