<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: left">
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>PROPOSAL 4: RESOLVED,</B> that, upon the effectiveness of Clause 8 of the second Restated
    MA and, effective on the date to be determined by the board of directors (the &ldquo;<B>Board</B>&rdquo;) of the Company, if at all,
    within one (1) calendar year from the date of the Meeting:</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&#9744;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&#9744;</TD>
  <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
  <TD>&#9744;</TD></TR>
