    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(a)</FONT></TD>
  <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">every one hundred (100) issued and unissued existing Class A Ordinary Shares of a par value of US$0.0016
  each, or such lesser whole share amount of not being less than two (2) as the Board may determine, be consolidated into one (1) class
  A ordinary share, ranking pari passu with each other and having the same rights and are subject to the same restrictions as the existing
  Class A Ordinary Shares;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
  <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
