    subject to all necessary governmental and regulatory consents, the deregistration of the Company as an exempted company under the
    laws of the Cayman Islands and the continuation of the Company into the British Virgin Islands as a BVI business company under the
    laws of the BVI be approved.</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
