<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Signed
for and on behalf of Ogier Global (BVI) Limited of Road Town, Tortola, British Virgin Islands</B></FONT></P>

